WEBVTT

00:07.689 --> 00:08.965
- Are you ready, kids?
- 孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:09.034 --> 00:10.655
all:
Aye, aye, Captain!
全部：
是啊是啊，队长！

00:10.724 --> 00:12.137
- I can't hear you.
- 我听不到你说话。

00:12.206 --> 00:14.103
all:
Aye, aye, Captain!
全部：
是啊是啊，队长！

00:14.172 --> 00:16.965
- ♪ Ohh... ♪
- ♪ 哦...♪

00:17.034 --> 00:19.275
♪ Who lives in a pineapple
under the sea? ♪
♪ 谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ ♪

00:19.344 --> 00:21.275
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:21.344 --> 00:23.137
- ♪ Absorbent and yellow
and porous is he ♪
- ♪ 吸水性和黄色
他是多孔的 ♪

00:23.206 --> 00:24.827
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:24.896 --> 00:27.310
- ♪ If nautical nonsense
be something you wish ♪
- ♪ 如果航海废话
成为你想要的东西♪

00:27.379 --> 00:29.103
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:29.172 --> 00:31.206
- ♪ Then drop on the deck
and flop like a fish ♪
- ♪ 然后落在甲板上
然后像鱼一样扑通扑通♪

00:31.275 --> 00:33.275
all: SpongeBob SquarePants!
- Ready?
所有：海绵宝宝！
- 准备好？

00:33.344 --> 00:35.310
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:35.379 --> 00:37.241
SpongeBob SquarePants!
海绵宝宝！

00:37.310 --> 00:39.413
SpongeBob SquarePants!
海绵宝宝！

00:39.482 --> 00:40.689
- SpongeBob
- 海绵宝宝

00:40.758 --> 00:42.551
SquarePants!
方裤！

00:42.620 --> 00:45.103
[laughing]
[笑]

00:45.172 --> 00:47.620
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

00:47.689 --> 00:49.241
[waves crashing]
[海浪拍打]

00:51.793 --> 00:54.724
[accordion music]
[手风琴音乐]

00:54.793 --> 01:02.068
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

01:03.689 --> 01:07.344
- Oh, thanks for the ride,
Dylan.
-哦，谢谢你的搭车，
迪伦.

01:07.413 --> 01:08.862
- No problem, Pearl.
- 没问题，珀尔。

01:08.931 --> 01:13.379
You still down
for that party tonight?
你还是低落
今晚参加那个聚会吗？

01:13.448 --> 01:18.379
- [gasping]
Oh, you bet!
- [喘气]
哦，你打赌！

01:22.275 --> 01:26.551
- Nautical.
I'll pick you up at eight.
- 航海。
我八点来接你。

01:27.724 --> 01:31.310
- Ooooh...
- 噢...

01:32.034 --> 01:35.137
[swooning sounds]
[昏厥的声音]

01:36.103 --> 01:37.241
[record scratch]
[记录刮痕]

01:37.310 --> 01:40.034
- Again?
Come on, Pearly girl,
- 再次？
来吧，珍珠女孩，

01:40.103 --> 01:42.931
we're running low
on doors here.
我们所剩无几了
在这里的门上。

01:43.000 --> 01:46.620
- Oh, I'm sorry daddy.
I'm just so excited to go
- 哦，对不起，爸爸。
我很兴奋要去

01:46.689 --> 01:49.103
to the big party tonight,
I, I just--
今晚的盛大聚会，
我，我只是——

01:49.172 --> 01:53.551
- Oh no!
No no no no no no no no no.
- 哦不！
不不不不不不不不不。

01:53.620 --> 01:56.413
Sorry sweetie, Daddy's
going out to play cards
对不起亲爱的，爸爸的
出去打牌

01:56.482 --> 01:57.862
with the boys tonight.
今晚和孩子们在一起。

01:57.931 --> 01:59.827
[cha-ching]
[查清]

01:59.896 --> 02:01.206
[chuckles]
[笑声]

02:01.275 --> 02:03.413
- But, but daddy!
- 但是，但是爸爸！

02:03.482 --> 02:05.586
- No buts!
I can't be worrying
- 没有但是！
我不能担心

02:05.655 --> 02:08.034
about you
all night, honey.
关于你
整个晚上，亲爱的。

02:08.103 --> 02:09.758
- [sniffling]
- [抽鼻子]

02:09.827 --> 02:14.620
But daddy, I want
to go to the party!
但爸爸，我想要
去参加聚会！

02:14.689 --> 02:16.103
[sobbing]
[抽泣]

02:16.172 --> 02:17.206
- Oh shrimp.
- 噢，虾。

02:17.275 --> 02:18.724
-[blubbering]
-[哭泣]

02:18.793 --> 02:20.241
- Whoa!
- 哇！

02:20.310 --> 02:23.896
- [Pearl sobs]
[buzz saw spinning]
- [珍珠抽泣]
[圆锯旋转]

02:23.965 --> 02:25.586
[clock cuckooing]
[时钟咕咕声]

02:25.655 --> 02:28.103
- [Krabs whimpering]
- [Pearl cries]
- [螃蟹呜咽]
- [珍珠哭泣]

02:28.172 --> 02:32.034
- Whew.
Hmm?
- 呼。
唔？

02:32.103 --> 02:33.310
- Aaah!
- 啊啊！

02:35.793 --> 02:37.793
There, there,
me little beluga.
那里，那里，
我小白鲸。

02:37.862 --> 02:39.275
It'll be okay.
会没事的。

02:39.344 --> 02:41.620
I hired Mr. Squidward
to baby-sit!
我雇佣了章鱼哥先生
去照顾孩子！

02:41.689 --> 02:43.793
Just like when
you were little.
就像当
你还小。

02:43.862 --> 02:45.206
[camera clicks]
[相机点击]

02:45.275 --> 02:47.103
[camera clicks]
[相机点击]

02:47.172 --> 02:49.068
[camera clicks]
[相机点击]

02:49.137 --> 02:52.931
- Ew, Dad!
Squidward is so lame!
- 呃，爸爸！
章鱼哥太蹩脚了！

02:53.000 --> 02:54.586
- Lame-shmame!
- 蹩脚的！

02:54.655 --> 02:57.137
You and Squidward
will have so much fun,
你和章鱼哥
将会有很多乐趣，

02:57.206 --> 03:00.241
You won't want
to go anywhere!
你不会想要
去任何地方！

03:00.310 --> 03:01.448
But just in case...
但以防万一...

03:01.517 --> 03:04.482
[alarm blares]
[警报声]

03:05.724 --> 03:08.034
- you won't be able
to go anywhere!
-你不能
去任何地方！

03:08.103 --> 03:09.379
[laughing]
[笑]

03:09.448 --> 03:11.482
[knocking on door]
Oh! Just in time.
[敲门]
哦！恰逢其时。

03:11.551 --> 03:13.482
- Mm-hmm.
Hmm?
- 嗯嗯。
唔？

03:13.551 --> 03:16.068
[buzzer blares]
Hmm?
[蜂鸣器鸣响]
嗯？

03:16.137 --> 03:18.344
- Squidward!
Thanks for keeping an eye
- 章鱼哥！
感谢您的关注

03:18.413 --> 03:19.931
on me little
Pearl tonight.
对我来说很少
今晚珍珠。

03:20.000 --> 03:21.034
- No problem.
- 没问题。

03:21.103 --> 03:22.206
- Remember our deal,
Squidward:
- 记住我们的协议，
章鱼哥：

03:22.275 --> 03:23.793
Keep Pearl
out of trouble,
保留珍珠
摆脱困境，

03:23.862 --> 03:25.344
and I'll give you
one shift a week
我会给你
每周一班

03:25.413 --> 03:26.758
without SpongeBob.
没有海绵宝宝。

03:26.827 --> 03:30.310
But if anything happens
to my little angel...
但如果有什么事情发生
致我的小天使...

03:30.379 --> 03:33.586
[screams]
[annoying laughter]
[尖叫声]
[烦人的笑声]

03:37.655 --> 03:40.344
- No, please!
Anything but that!
- 不，拜托！
除了那个之外什么都可以！

03:40.413 --> 03:44.034
Don't worry, Mr. Krabs.
You can count on me.
别担心，蟹老板。
你可以信赖我。

03:44.103 --> 03:45.655
- I knew I could.
- 我知道我可以。

03:45.724 --> 03:48.068
[humming]
[嗡嗡声]

03:48.137 --> 03:50.310
- Phew.
- Oh thanks for watching
- 唷。
- 哦，谢谢您的观看

03:50.379 --> 03:51.931
the house tonight,
Squidward.
今晚的房子，
章鱼哥。

03:52.000 --> 03:55.620
I'll be back late, so
y'know don't wait up for me!
我会晚点回来，所以
你知道别等我！

03:55.689 --> 03:57.965
- [grunting]
Your dad said we have
- [咕哝]
你爸爸说我们有

03:58.034 --> 04:00.344
to stay in tonight...
[grunting]
今晚要留在...
[咕噜声]

04:00.413 --> 04:02.310
But that doesn't
mean we can't have...
但这并不
意味着我们不能...

04:02.379 --> 04:03.758
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

04:03.827 --> 04:04.931
Fun!
乐趣！

04:05.000 --> 04:08.379
- [groaning]
- [呻吟]

04:11.689 --> 04:15.344
- Look, we could play with
this Cetaceous Sally doll.
- 看，我们可以一起玩
这个鲸类莎莉娃娃。

04:15.413 --> 04:18.137
Or we could color
this princess coloring book.
或者我们可以上色
这本公主图画书。

04:18.206 --> 04:20.275
Or we could
sing along with--
或者我们可以
跟着唱——

04:20.344 --> 04:22.206
Aaah!
啊啊！

04:22.275 --> 04:25.137
[gasps]
Sally!
[喘气]
莎莉！

04:25.206 --> 04:27.068
Aaaaah!
啊啊啊！

04:27.137 --> 04:29.068
Outside the lines.
线外。

04:29.137 --> 04:30.724
[cringing]
[畏缩]

04:32.034 --> 04:32.965
Hmm.
唔。

04:33.034 --> 04:34.655
Pearl?
珍珠？

04:34.724 --> 04:36.103
Hello?
你好？

04:36.172 --> 04:39.068
Hmm.
Hey, uh, Pearl...
唔。
嘿，呃，珍珠……

04:39.137 --> 04:40.793
Ummm...
嗯...

04:40.862 --> 04:41.965
Whatcha up to?
到底在忙什么？

04:42.034 --> 04:43.586
- Arts and crafts.
- 艺术和手工艺。

04:43.655 --> 04:46.310
- Hey, I dabble
in the arts myself.
- 嘿，我涉足
我自己在艺术方面。

04:46.379 --> 04:48.068
Maybe I could help!
也许我可以帮忙！

04:48.137 --> 04:49.275
[evil laugh]
[邪恶的笑声]

04:49.344 --> 04:51.655
- [yelps]
Uh never mind, I--
- [尖叫声]
呃，没关系，我——

04:51.724 --> 04:53.068
You seem to have
that under control.
你似乎有
一切都在控制之中。

04:53.137 --> 04:56.379
I'll just, um, be out here
if you need me.
我就，嗯，就在这里
如果你需要我。

04:56.448 --> 04:59.655
Or not.
Preferably not.
或不。
最好不是。

05:01.172 --> 05:03.448
That is one morbid teen.
那是一个病态的青少年。

05:03.517 --> 05:05.551
That ought to keep him
out of my hair.
这应该让他
从我的头发里出来。

05:05.620 --> 05:06.931
[horn honks]
Hmm?
[喇叭鸣响]
嗯？

05:07.000 --> 05:10.000
[groovy music]
[动听的音乐]

05:12.517 --> 05:14.344
[horn honking]
[喇叭鸣响]

05:15.068 --> 05:17.344
It's go time!
出发时间到了！

05:20.758 --> 05:23.034
[snoring]
[打鼾]

05:25.344 --> 05:27.241
[grunts]
[咕哝]

05:27.310 --> 05:29.827
[chuckles]
[笑声]

05:31.000 --> 05:33.275
[sobbing]
[抽泣]

05:33.344 --> 05:35.793
[snickering]
[窃笑]

05:35.862 --> 05:37.931
[grunts]
[咕哝]

05:39.241 --> 05:42.689
[groaning]
[呻吟]

05:44.206 --> 05:46.827
- [yelping]
Oh!
- [尖叫]
哦！

05:46.896 --> 05:47.896
What's happening?
发生什么事了？

05:47.965 --> 05:49.551
Pearl?
珍珠？

05:49.620 --> 05:52.000
Oh.
You asleep?
哦。
你睡着了吗？

05:52.068 --> 05:56.655
Aww, she must have
tuckered herself out.
哇，她一定有
她把自己蜷缩起来。

05:58.310 --> 06:01.517
Aah!
Oh, no!
啊啊！
哦，不！

06:01.586 --> 06:05.344
Maybe if we get it on ice
they can reattach it!
也许如果我们把它放在冰上
他们可以重新连接它！

06:05.413 --> 06:06.689
[yelping]
[尖叫]

06:06.758 --> 06:09.862
[muffled screaming]
[低沉的尖叫声]

06:10.517 --> 06:11.655
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

06:11.724 --> 06:13.896
[gasping for breath]
[喘气]

06:13.965 --> 06:14.965
Aaah.
啊啊。

06:15.034 --> 06:18.275
- Oh thanks for
the ride, Dylan.
- 哦，谢谢
骑行，迪伦。

06:18.344 --> 06:19.551
- No prob.
- 没问题。

06:19.620 --> 06:20.965
- [grunting]
- [咕哝]

06:21.034 --> 06:24.827
She's gone!
Krabs is gonna kill me!
她走了！
螃蟹要杀了我！

06:24.896 --> 06:28.034
[playful accordion music]
[俏皮的手风琴音乐]

06:28.103 --> 06:35.103
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

06:48.896 --> 06:51.758
- Um, that sign
said "surface."
- 嗯，那个标志
说“表面”。

06:51.827 --> 06:54.448
Are you sure
this is the way?
你确定吗
这是路吗？

06:54.517 --> 06:56.206
- For sure, babe.
We're going to
- 当然，宝贝。
我们要去

06:56.275 --> 06:58.000
a breach party.
违约方。

06:58.068 --> 07:01.931
- Oh, I've never been
to one of those before.
-哦，我从来没有去过
到之前的其中之一。

07:02.000 --> 07:03.103
Sounds exciting.
听起来很令人兴奋。

07:03.172 --> 07:04.586
[tires peel out]
[轮胎剥落]

07:04.655 --> 07:06.448
- Whoo!
- 呼！

07:06.517 --> 07:09.137
- Hmm, hmm, hmm, hmm.
- 嗯，嗯，嗯，嗯。

07:09.206 --> 07:10.206
[tires screeching]
[轮胎的尖叫声]

07:11.448 --> 07:14.586
Hmm.
Still warm.
唔。
还是温暖的。

07:14.655 --> 07:16.551
The surface, eh?
表面，嗯？

07:16.620 --> 07:20.103
That SpongeBob-free
shift will be mine!
没有海绵宝宝
转变将是我的！

07:20.172 --> 07:23.172
[huffing and puffing]
[气喘吁吁]

07:26.965 --> 07:28.000
Aaaah!
啊啊啊！

07:28.068 --> 07:30.172
[groaning]
[呻吟]

07:30.241 --> 07:33.344
SpongeBob...shift...mine...
海绵宝宝……变身……我的……

07:33.413 --> 07:35.241
- [laughing]
- [笑]

07:38.275 --> 07:39.965
- [swooning]
- [昏厥]

07:40.034 --> 07:41.344
[munching]
[咀嚼]

07:41.413 --> 07:44.620
Mmm, oh Dylan.
嗯，哦迪伦。

07:45.655 --> 07:48.241
All: Chug, chug, chug, chug!
全体：嘎嘎，嘎嘎，嘎嘎，嘎嘎！

07:48.310 --> 07:53.379
All: Breach, breach, breach,
breach, breach, breach--
全部：违规，违规，违规，
违规、违规、违规——

07:53.448 --> 07:55.241
- [burps]
- [打嗝]

07:55.310 --> 07:56.551
[satisfying moan]
[满足的呻吟声]

07:56.620 --> 07:57.827
All: Whoo-hoo!
全体：呼呼！

07:57.896 --> 08:00.068
[groovy music playing]
[美妙的音乐演奏]

08:00.137 --> 08:03.172
[party chatter]
[聚会闲聊]

08:03.241 --> 08:05.068
- [grunting]
- [咕哝]

08:05.137 --> 08:06.965
[gasping]
[喘气]

08:07.034 --> 08:08.206
Pearl!
珍珠！

08:08.275 --> 08:10.379
[all gasping]
[全都喘气]

08:10.448 --> 08:13.275
- You have to
come home, right away!
- 你必须
回家吧，马上！

08:13.344 --> 08:16.655
We can do whatever
you want if we go back now!
我们可以做任何事
你要我们现在就回去吧！

08:16.724 --> 08:18.448
I'll even play
you some jazz!
我什至会玩
你来点爵士乐吧！

08:18.517 --> 08:19.793
Kids love jazz!
孩子们喜欢爵士乐！

08:19.862 --> 08:23.034
[screeching flute]
[all groaning]
[尖叫的长笛]
[全都呻吟]

08:25.137 --> 08:27.172
♪ Come on Pearl,
let's go home ♪
♪ 来吧，珍珠，
我们回家吧♪

08:27.241 --> 08:29.275
♪ I can't leave here
all alone ♪
♪ 我不能离开这里
独自一人♪

08:29.344 --> 08:32.206
♪ Let's get back
before your dad... ♪
♪ 我们回去吧
在你爸爸面前……♪

08:32.275 --> 08:34.551
[scatting]
[分散]

08:34.620 --> 08:38.793
- No!
- Jazz...making me...nerdier!
- 不！
- 爵士乐...让我...变得更书呆子！

08:38.862 --> 08:41.517
[both groaning]
[两人都呻吟]

08:41.586 --> 08:43.551
[flute screeching]
[长笛尖叫]

08:43.620 --> 08:46.206
- Oh, this is
so embarrassing!
- 哦，这是
太尴尬了！

08:46.275 --> 08:49.172
- Forget him Pearl,
let's breach.
- 忘了他吧，珍珠，
让我们突破吧。

08:49.241 --> 08:50.310
[all cheering]
[大家欢呼]

08:50.379 --> 08:52.310
- Aaah!
- 啊啊！

08:52.379 --> 08:53.551
Yeah!
是的！

08:53.620 --> 08:56.379
[all cheering]
[大家欢呼]

08:56.448 --> 08:58.793
- I don't know.
Is it dangerous?
- 我不知道。
危险吗？

08:58.862 --> 09:01.172
- Uh-uh, babe.
It's nautical.
- 呃呃，宝贝。
这是航海的。

09:01.241 --> 09:02.413
- [gasps]
- [喘气]

09:02.482 --> 09:04.137
[swooning]
[昏厥]

09:04.206 --> 09:05.137
- Pearl!
- 珍珠！

09:05.206 --> 09:06.724
What about yo-yos?
溜溜球呢？

09:06.793 --> 09:08.310
Kids love yo-yo--
孩子们喜欢溜溜球——

09:08.379 --> 09:10.241
Oof!
钱币！

09:11.000 --> 09:13.586
- Okay, let's do it!
- 好吧，我们开始吧！

09:13.655 --> 09:17.068
One...two...three...
一二三...

09:17.137 --> 09:20.172
Yahoo!
雅虎！

09:20.241 --> 09:24.413
This is so coral!
这太珊瑚了！

09:24.482 --> 09:25.620
Oof!
钱币！

09:25.689 --> 09:28.689
[gasping]
[喘气]

09:28.758 --> 09:31.206
Dylan, help!
迪伦，救命啊！

09:31.275 --> 09:34.275
This isn't nautical!
这不是航海！

09:34.344 --> 09:36.517
- Oh man, she's beached.
- 天哪，她已经搁浅了。

09:36.586 --> 09:38.620
- We're gonna be
in so much trouble!
- 我们会是
遇到这么多麻烦！

09:38.689 --> 09:40.172
- Leave her!
Let's cheese it!
- 离开她！
让我们干酪吧！

09:40.241 --> 09:42.344
- Let's get out of here.
- [grunting]
- 我们离开这里吧。
- [咕哝]

09:42.413 --> 09:44.448
Oh, no!
哦，不！

09:44.517 --> 09:46.275
- Pearl!
Are you all right?
- 珍珠！
你还好吗？

09:46.344 --> 09:51.172
- Oh, Squidward, I'm so sorry
I didn't listen to you!
-哦，章鱼哥，我很抱歉
我没听你的！

09:51.241 --> 09:52.137
- It's okay.
- 没关系。

09:52.206 --> 09:54.172
Let's just get you
out of here.
让我们来接你吧
离开这里。

09:54.241 --> 09:57.379
[straining]
[紧张]

09:57.448 --> 09:59.344
Oof!
钱币！

09:59.413 --> 10:01.517
[muffled grunting]
[低沉的咕噜声]

10:01.586 --> 10:03.172
Oh.
哦。

10:03.241 --> 10:05.655
Okay, okay.
Just, hold on a second.
好吧，好吧。
只是，等一下。

10:05.724 --> 10:08.034
- Hold on?
What are you--
- 坚持，稍等？
你是做什么的 -

10:08.103 --> 10:09.275
Gah.
嘎。

10:09.344 --> 10:11.034
- [huffing]
- [气喘吁吁]

10:11.517 --> 10:14.758
- [grunting]
- [咕哝]

10:15.413 --> 10:18.310
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

10:18.379 --> 10:20.758
Aaah.
啊啊。

10:23.310 --> 10:24.655
- [grunting]
- [咕哝]

10:24.724 --> 10:25.827
- Huh?
- 啊？

10:25.896 --> 10:29.103
[burps and yells]
[打嗝和叫喊]

10:32.310 --> 10:34.103
Aaaah!
啊啊啊！

10:40.586 --> 10:42.448
[whimpering]
[呜咽]

10:42.517 --> 10:45.137
[sobbing]
[抽泣]

10:45.206 --> 10:48.275
I can't believe Dylan
ditched me.
我不敢相信迪伦
抛弃了我。

10:48.344 --> 10:50.758
My life is over.
我的生命结束了。

10:50.827 --> 10:53.310
- Oh, I don't think
it's that bad.
- 哦，我不认为
太糟糕了。

10:53.379 --> 10:54.344
- Aaah.
- 啊啊。

10:54.413 --> 10:55.827
[piercing sound]
[刺耳的声音]

10:59.000 --> 11:02.344
- I'll um, just get you home.
- 我会，嗯，送你回家。

11:02.413 --> 11:04.206
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

11:04.275 --> 11:06.862
Narrator:
Many, many minutes later...
旁白：
很多很多分钟之后……

11:06.931 --> 11:10.137
- [grunting]
- [咕哝]

11:13.655 --> 11:15.000
Oh.
哦。

11:15.068 --> 11:17.241
- [sighs]
Guess I'll just wait
- [叹气]
我想我只会等待

11:17.310 --> 11:19.482
for my dad to get home.
为了让我爸爸回家。

11:19.551 --> 11:22.793
- Ya know, there is a way
we could still have
- 你知道，有办法
我们仍然可以拥有

11:22.862 --> 11:25.724
a little
fun tonight.
一点
今晚很有趣。

11:25.793 --> 11:28.793
- Really?
- 真的吗？

11:28.862 --> 11:30.379
[both snickering]
[两人窃笑]

11:30.448 --> 11:33.689
[doorbell ringing]
[门铃响]

11:33.758 --> 11:36.827
- Like, hello?
- 就像，你好？

11:36.896 --> 11:39.517
Hmm?
Huh?
唔？
啊？

11:39.586 --> 11:42.655
[annoying laughter]
- Aaah!
[烦人的笑声]
- 啊啊！

11:43.103 --> 11:46.310
[SpongeBob laughs,
Dylan screams]
[海绵宝宝笑了，
迪伦尖叫]

11:46.689 --> 11:49.931
[both snickering]
[两人窃笑]

11:53.000 --> 11:56.000
[ukulele music]
[尤克里里音乐]

11:56.068 --> 12:01.965
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

12:02.034 --> 12:04.965
[humming]
[嗡嗡声]

12:05.034 --> 12:07.517
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

12:07.586 --> 12:09.724
Ya-bow.
雅-鞠躬。

12:09.793 --> 12:12.586
Delivery--
Whoa!
发货--
哇！

12:12.655 --> 12:14.000
Whaaa!
哇啊！

12:14.068 --> 12:16.413
Oof!
钱币！

12:16.482 --> 12:18.689
Delivery.
送货。

12:18.758 --> 12:22.448
- Will you ever learn
how to use those doors?
- 你会学习吗
如何使用这些门？

12:22.517 --> 12:23.896
- Never.
- 绝不。

12:23.965 --> 12:26.137
[humming]
[嗡嗡声]

12:26.206 --> 12:28.344
[elevator dings]
[电梯叮叮声]

12:28.413 --> 12:31.000
[humming]
[嗡嗡声]

12:32.103 --> 12:33.379
Hmm.
唔。

12:33.448 --> 12:37.448
- Has anybody seen
my delivery?
- 有谁看过吗
我的交货？

12:37.517 --> 12:39.758
Delivery coming.
送货来了。

12:39.827 --> 12:41.137
- Huh?
- 啊？

12:43.000 --> 12:44.724
- Pardon me.
- Whoa!
- 请原谅我。
- 哇！

12:44.793 --> 12:47.103
- Hey!
- Oof.
- 嘿！
- 噢。

12:47.172 --> 12:50.103
- Oh, I've heard of this.
Davey Jones' cubicle.
- 哦，我听说过这个。
戴维·琼斯的小隔间。

12:50.172 --> 12:51.241
[yells]
[喊叫]

12:51.310 --> 12:53.068
[SpongeBob groans]
- [gasps]
[海绵宝宝呻吟]
- [喘气]

12:53.137 --> 12:54.344
- Your delivery, ma'am.
- 您的送货，女士。

12:54.413 --> 12:57.620
[stammering]
Whoa, whoa!
[结巴]
哇哦！

13:03.758 --> 13:05.620
Ah.
啊。

13:05.689 --> 13:08.103
Phew.
唷。

13:08.172 --> 13:09.517
[groaning]
[呻吟]

13:09.586 --> 13:10.724
Oh, no.
哦，不。

13:10.793 --> 13:12.482
A delicious
Krusty Krab disaster.
一个美味的
蟹堡王灾难。

13:12.551 --> 13:14.655
Call the shore patrol.
Get an ambulance.
呼叫岸边巡逻队。
叫辆救护车。

13:14.724 --> 13:18.517
Does anyone know CSR?
Chocolate Shake Resuscitation.
有人了解企业社会责任吗？
巧克力奶昔复苏。

13:21.206 --> 13:23.172
[squishing]
[压扁]

13:23.241 --> 13:26.172
- It's all right.
Just leave it.
- 没关系。
就留下它吧。

13:26.241 --> 13:28.137
- Here, you can
drink it from here!
- 在这里，你可以
从这里喝吧！

13:28.206 --> 13:30.275
See?
[slurps]
看？
[啜饮]

13:32.413 --> 13:34.344
Yow.
哟。

13:34.413 --> 13:36.827
It's too late.
I did all I could
太晚了。
我已经尽力了

13:36.896 --> 13:38.103
but it wasn't enough.
但这还不够。

13:38.172 --> 13:40.655
I'll just clean up
the remains.
我只会清理
遗骸。

13:40.724 --> 13:43.931
[groaning]
[呻吟]

13:44.000 --> 13:44.931
- Enough.
- 足够的。

13:45.000 --> 13:46.896
Just go.
I'm busy.
走吧。
我很忙。

13:46.965 --> 13:49.620
- In ancient times
one would fall on their sword
- 在古代
有人会倒在他们的剑上

13:49.689 --> 13:51.241
by way of apology.
以道歉的方式。

13:51.310 --> 13:55.724
We at the Krusty Krab
keep that tradition.
我们在蟹堡王
保持这个传统。

13:55.793 --> 13:58.655
[slicing sound, groans]
[切割声、呻吟声]

13:58.724 --> 14:00.137
And now that
that's out of the way,
现在那
那不碍事

14:00.206 --> 14:01.827
I am going to give you
我要给你

14:01.896 --> 14:06.103
the Krusty Krab Customer
Service Pledge of Satisfaction.
蟹堡王顾客
满意服务承诺。

14:06.172 --> 14:07.758
I pledge to come back
here tonight,
我保证会回来
今晚在这里，

14:07.827 --> 14:13.000
and clean this carpet
and make it shine.
并清洁这块地毯
并让它闪闪发光。

14:13.068 --> 14:15.517
As a matter of fact,
I'll clean all your offices
事实上，
我会打扫你所有的办公室

14:15.586 --> 14:19.586
and all your cubicles.
Courtesy of The Krusty Krab.
以及你所有的小隔间。
由蟹堡王提供。

14:19.655 --> 14:21.275
- There's no need.
We have a cleaning robot
- 没必要。
我们有一个清洁机器人

14:21.344 --> 14:24.758
that does that all at night.
整个晚上都是这样。

14:24.827 --> 14:27.137
- No, mom,
I'm not double checking
- 不，妈妈，
我没有双重检查

14:27.206 --> 14:28.620
that the doors are locked.
门是锁着的。

14:28.689 --> 14:29.896
Stop nagging me.
别再唠叨我了。

14:29.965 --> 14:31.896
[indistinct chatter]
- I love you too.
[模糊的喋喋不休]
- 我也爱你。

14:31.965 --> 14:34.448
- Thanks for loaning me
your cleaning cart, Patrick.
- 谢谢你借给我
你的清洁车，帕特里克。

14:34.517 --> 14:37.034
- [munching, grunting]
Cleaning cart?
- [咀嚼，咕噜声]
清洁车？

14:37.103 --> 14:40.103
I thought this was
a food cart?
我以为这是
食品车？

14:40.172 --> 14:42.103
[both yelling]
The best door ever!
[两人大喊]
有史以来最好的门！

14:42.172 --> 14:43.206
Together: Whaaa!
一起：哇啊！

14:43.275 --> 14:45.034
- Hold on.
- 坚持，稍等。

14:45.103 --> 14:47.896
[yelps]
[尖叫声]

14:50.241 --> 14:53.931
- Trash.
- 垃圾。

14:54.000 --> 14:55.482
[burps]
[打嗝]

14:55.551 --> 14:57.103
[beeping]
[嘟嘟声]

14:57.172 --> 14:59.241
[both yelling]
[两人大喊]

14:59.310 --> 15:02.206
- Aaah!
Paper shredder!
- 啊啊！
碎纸机！

15:02.275 --> 15:04.000
[shredding sounds]
[撕碎声]

15:04.068 --> 15:05.034
[gasps]
[喘气]

15:05.103 --> 15:07.448
Ah.
啊。

15:07.517 --> 15:10.310
No two shreds are alike.
没有两片碎片是相同的。

15:10.379 --> 15:12.000
- Let's start here
and make our way
- 让我们从这里开始
并让路

15:12.068 --> 15:14.275
to the milkshake stain.
到奶昔污渍。

15:15.206 --> 15:16.724
- [humming]
- [嗡嗡声]

15:16.793 --> 15:17.551
[groaning, grunting]
[呻吟，咕哝]

15:17.620 --> 15:18.655
I got it.
I got it.
我得到了它。
我得到了它。

15:18.724 --> 15:22.793
I got it.
我得到了它。

15:23.793 --> 15:25.379
[grunts]
[咕哝]

15:25.448 --> 15:27.172
[electricity crackling]
[电力噼啪声]

15:27.241 --> 15:29.241
♪ Working guy,
working guy ♪
♪ 上班族，
上班族♪

15:29.310 --> 15:31.379
♪ Working guy, working guy ♪
♪ 工作人员，工作人员 ♪

15:32.068 --> 15:34.965
- [humming]
- [嗡嗡声]

15:37.862 --> 15:40.793
[upbeat music]
[欢快的音乐]

15:40.862 --> 15:47.206
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

15:47.275 --> 15:49.689
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

15:49.758 --> 15:51.137
[elevator dings]
[电梯叮叮声]

15:51.206 --> 15:53.758
[beeping]
Trash.
[嘟嘟声]
垃圾。

15:53.827 --> 15:55.241
Trash.
垃圾。

15:55.310 --> 15:56.931
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

15:57.000 --> 15:58.655
Trash.
垃圾。

15:58.724 --> 16:01.724
[dramatic music]
[戏剧音乐]

16:01.793 --> 16:04.000
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

16:04.068 --> 16:05.172
[burps]
[打嗝]

16:05.241 --> 16:06.655
Trash.
垃圾。

16:06.724 --> 16:08.448
- [humming]
- [嗡嗡声]

16:08.517 --> 16:11.758
- [gleefully yelling]
- [高兴地大喊]

16:12.310 --> 16:13.931
Oh.
哦。

16:20.275 --> 16:22.310
- Hm.
- 嗯。

16:24.448 --> 16:26.689
- Can I just say oops.
- 我可以说哎呀吗？

16:26.758 --> 16:29.310
- Not a problem.
We'll just put them all back up
- 没问题。
我们会把它们全部备份起来

16:29.379 --> 16:31.724
the way they were.
他们本来的样子。

16:32.275 --> 16:33.586
[both grunting]
[两人都咕哝着]

16:33.655 --> 16:35.241
- There.
Good as new.
- 那里。
完好如新。

16:35.310 --> 16:36.482
- Uh...
- 呃...

16:36.551 --> 16:38.931
How do we get out of here?
我们怎样才能离开这里？

16:39.000 --> 16:41.241
- Uh, maybe this way?
- 呃，也许是这样？

16:42.448 --> 16:44.655
Oh, or, uh, this way.
哦，或者，呃，这边走。

16:44.724 --> 16:47.931
[videogame music,
both grunting]
[电子游戏音乐，
两人都咕哝着]

16:50.310 --> 16:51.655
Oop, missed one.
Huh--
哎呀，漏了一个。
呃——

16:51.724 --> 16:53.241
- Trash.
- 垃圾。

16:53.310 --> 16:54.551
- Hey, that's mine.
- 嘿，那是我的。

16:54.620 --> 16:56.482
I'm cleaning these offices.
[grunts]
我正在打扫这些办公室。
[咕哝]

16:56.551 --> 16:58.275
- [growls]
- Patrick, catch.
- [咆哮]
- 帕特里克，接住。

16:58.344 --> 17:00.068
[grunts]
[咕哝]

17:02.448 --> 17:05.310
- [groans]
- [buzzing, beeping]
- [呻吟]
- [嗡嗡声，嘟嘟声]

17:05.379 --> 17:07.448
Trash.
垃圾。

17:07.517 --> 17:09.310
[saw buzzing]
- No!
[看到嗡嗡声]
- 不！

17:09.379 --> 17:10.379
- Run!
- 跑步！

17:10.448 --> 17:13.827
[both yelling, grunting]
[两人都大喊大叫，咕哝着]

17:13.896 --> 17:16.034
[saw cutting]
[锯切]

17:16.103 --> 17:18.034
[both breathing heavy]
[两人呼吸粗重]

17:18.103 --> 17:20.586
[yelling]
[大喊]

17:20.655 --> 17:23.413
- [grunting]
[saw cutting]
- [咕哝]
[锯切]

17:24.413 --> 17:26.310
- Grrr.
- 呃。

17:26.379 --> 17:27.965
- Ugh.
- 呃。

17:29.448 --> 17:31.931
- Boo boo.
- 嘘嘘。

17:32.000 --> 17:32.931
[digital beeping]
[数字蜂鸣声]

17:33.000 --> 17:34.000
[tires squealing]
[轮胎吱吱声]

17:34.068 --> 17:36.689
[both yelling]
[两人大喊]

17:39.517 --> 17:42.620
- Oh, no.
I'm bleeding.
- 哦，不。
我在流血。

17:42.689 --> 17:44.724
It's okay.
It's decaf.
没关系。
它不含咖啡因。

17:44.793 --> 17:46.068
- [moaning]
- [呻吟]

17:46.137 --> 17:48.551
- Trash, trash, trash.
- 垃圾，垃圾，垃圾。

17:48.620 --> 17:50.724
- SpongeBob, why is
this happening?
- 海绵宝宝，为什么
这发生了？

17:50.793 --> 17:54.793
- Trash, trash,
trash, trash, trash.
- 垃圾，垃圾，
垃圾，垃圾，垃圾。

17:54.862 --> 17:58.034
[whimpering]
[whirring, beeping]
[呜咽]
[呼呼声，嘟嘟声]

17:58.758 --> 18:01.241
Trash.
垃圾。

18:01.310 --> 18:02.655
Trash.
垃圾。

18:02.724 --> 18:05.724
- Um, you--look,
you garbage-can thing.
- 嗯，你——看，
你这个垃圾桶东西。

18:05.793 --> 18:07.172
I don't know
what we did to you
我不知道
我们对你做了什么

18:07.241 --> 18:09.517
but I made a Krusty Krab pledge
to your boss
但我做出了蟹堡王的承诺
给你的老板

18:09.586 --> 18:10.724
to clean these offices.
清洁这些办公室。

18:10.793 --> 18:13.310
[beeping, whirring]
- Oh!
[嘟嘟声，呼呼声]
- 哦！

18:13.379 --> 18:15.379
[groaning]
[呻吟]

18:15.448 --> 18:18.551
- Whoa.
- 哇哦。

18:18.620 --> 18:20.551
Ow!
My rump is roasting.
噢！
我的臀部在烤。

18:20.620 --> 18:23.379
- Hey!
Patrick may be trashy...
- 嘿！
帕特里克可能很垃圾……

18:23.448 --> 18:24.724
- [burps]
- [打嗝]

18:24.793 --> 18:26.379
- But he's not trash.
- 但他不是垃圾。

18:26.448 --> 18:29.103
[yelling, whimpering]
[大喊大叫，呜咽]

18:29.172 --> 18:30.310
- Whoa.
Oh.
- 哇哦。
哦。

18:30.379 --> 18:32.862
[SpongeBob yelling]
- [sighs]
[海绵宝宝大喊大叫]
- [叹气]

18:32.931 --> 18:35.000
Hmm?
唔？

18:36.068 --> 18:38.448
Mmm, Patrick soup.
嗯，帕特里克汤。

18:38.517 --> 18:41.724
- [grunting, yelling]
- [咕哝，大喊]

18:45.379 --> 18:47.482
- Whoa, whoa, whoa,
whoa, whoa, whoa!
- 哇，哇，哇，
哇，哇，哇！

18:47.551 --> 18:50.206
Whoa, whoa, whoa,
whoa, whoa, whoa!
哇，哇，哇，
哇，哇，哇！

18:50.275 --> 18:51.931
[thudding]
[重击]

18:52.000 --> 18:53.931
[groans]
[呻吟]

18:54.000 --> 18:56.034
Sorry to do this.
But you'll have to stay here
很抱歉这样做。
但你必须留在这里

18:56.103 --> 18:57.620
until we finish cleaning.
直到我们完成清洁工作。

18:57.689 --> 18:59.103
Here.
This should tide you over
这里。
这应该能让你渡过难关

18:59.172 --> 19:01.206
till we're done.
直到我们完成。

19:01.275 --> 19:02.482
- [burps]
- [打嗝]

19:04.137 --> 19:05.517
- Whew.
Finally.
- 呼。
最后。

19:05.586 --> 19:08.344
Patrick, meet
the main stain that I disdain.
帕特里克，见面吧
我所鄙视的主要污点。

19:08.413 --> 19:09.448
- [laughing]
- [笑]

19:09.517 --> 19:10.793
- Oh, what do you know.
- 哦，你知道什么。

19:10.862 --> 19:12.931
This cleaner contains
saliva enzymes
该清洁剂含有
唾液酶

19:13.000 --> 19:14.931
that break down
chocolate particles.
崩溃的
巧克力颗粒。

19:15.000 --> 19:16.551
Hmm.
You know if we wanted to
唔。
你知道我们是否愿意

19:16.620 --> 19:17.724
we could just--
我们可以——

19:17.793 --> 19:19.379
- [slurping, licking]
- [吸食，舔]

19:19.448 --> 19:21.034
Way ahead of ya.
远远领先于你。

19:21.103 --> 19:23.206
- Make room.
- 腾出空间。

19:23.275 --> 19:26.206
[both licking, slurping]
[都舔，吸吮]

19:26.275 --> 19:28.448
[pounding]
Huh?
[重击]
啊？

19:28.517 --> 19:29.896
[both licking, slurping]
[都舔，吸吮]

19:29.965 --> 19:31.482
[pounding]
[重击]

19:31.551 --> 19:33.620
[dramatic music]
[戏剧音乐]

19:33.689 --> 19:35.172
[whirring, whizzing]
[呼呼，呼呼]

19:35.241 --> 19:39.793
- Eliminate intruders.
- 消灭入侵者。

19:48.103 --> 19:51.103
[beeping]
[嘟嘟声]

19:52.586 --> 19:55.379
- [slurping]
- [发出声音]

19:55.448 --> 19:57.137
[gulps]
[吞咽]

19:57.206 --> 19:58.448
[yelps]
Ew.
[尖叫声]
呃。

19:58.517 --> 19:59.724
Patrick,
stop sweating on me.
帕特里克，
别再为我出汗了。

19:59.793 --> 20:02.931
- I ran out of sweat
an hour ago.
- 我已经流汗了
一小时前。

20:04.965 --> 20:05.896
[beeping]
[嘟嘟声]

20:05.965 --> 20:08.241
both: Aah!
Coffee killer!
两人：啊啊！
咖啡杀手！

20:08.310 --> 20:09.413
[plane whizzing]
[飞机呼啸]

20:09.482 --> 20:11.896
[both yelling]
[两人大喊]

20:11.965 --> 20:14.793
[beeping]
[嘟嘟声]

20:15.620 --> 20:18.206
- You again.
- 又是你。

20:18.275 --> 20:19.724
- Oh, good.
Soda.
- 哦，很好。
苏打。

20:19.793 --> 20:22.896
I was getting
thirsty again.
我正在得到
又渴了。

20:22.965 --> 20:24.482
Aaah.
啊啊。

20:25.103 --> 20:27.310
[grunting, yelling]
[咕哝，大喊]

20:27.379 --> 20:28.379
- This is not refreshing.
- 这并不令人耳目一新。

20:28.448 --> 20:30.965
Ow, oh.
噢，噢。

20:31.034 --> 20:32.482
- Grrr.
- 呃。

20:32.551 --> 20:33.517
Gah.
嘎。

20:33.586 --> 20:35.620
[explosion]
[爆炸]

20:38.517 --> 20:40.931
[electronic buzzing]
[电子嗡嗡声]

20:41.000 --> 20:41.931
- Aaah.
- 啊啊。

20:42.000 --> 20:43.068
Whoa.
哇哦。

20:43.137 --> 20:45.413
[groaning, grunting]
[呻吟，咕哝]

20:45.482 --> 20:47.655
[painful yelling]
[痛苦的叫喊]

20:47.724 --> 20:51.448
- Man, you do not
take a bad picture.
- 伙计，你不
拍一张不好的照片。

20:51.517 --> 20:53.724
- [screaming]
- [尖叫]

20:53.793 --> 20:57.103
[muffled groaning]
[低沉的呻吟声]

20:58.137 --> 20:59.172
- Hang in there, buddy.
- 坚持住，伙计。

20:59.241 --> 21:00.344
Hang in there.
坚持住。

21:00.413 --> 21:03.724
[panicked whimpering]
[惊慌的呜咽声]

21:05.172 --> 21:08.068
[sighs]
[叹气]

21:08.137 --> 21:09.758
- [groans]
- [呻吟]

21:10.724 --> 21:12.068
- [happy yell]
- [高兴地大喊]

21:12.137 --> 21:13.793
- Hey, where'd you get
the tank, Patrick?
- 嘿，你从哪里来的
坦克，帕特里克？

21:13.862 --> 21:17.827
- It's what this company makes:
Tanks.
- 这就是这家公司生产的产品：
坦克。

21:17.896 --> 21:20.793
- How did I not notice that?
- 我怎么没注意到？

21:21.793 --> 21:23.310
We'll use these
as ammunition.
我们将使用这些
作为弹药。

21:23.379 --> 21:26.172
[grunts]
[咕哝]

21:26.241 --> 21:29.172
[suspenseful music]
[悬疑音乐]

21:29.241 --> 21:31.551
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

21:31.620 --> 21:34.655
- Retreat.
Retreat.
- 撤退。
撤退。

21:59.344 --> 22:01.793
[muffled groans]
[低沉的呻吟声]

22:04.448 --> 22:05.586
Huh?
啊？

22:05.655 --> 22:07.413
- Hello.
- 你好。

22:07.482 --> 22:09.448
[electronic whirring, buzzing]
[电子呼呼声、嗡嗡声]

22:09.517 --> 22:11.551
- Hey Trash Bot.
- 嘿垃圾机器人。

22:11.620 --> 22:14.034
[grunts]
[咕哝]

22:15.655 --> 22:17.172
- [burps]
- [打嗝]

22:17.241 --> 22:20.862
Mmm.
Trash.
嗯。
垃圾。

22:25.275 --> 22:27.206
[both grunting]
[两人都咕哝着]

22:27.275 --> 22:30.103
- SpongeBob SquarePants
always keeps his word.
- 海绵宝宝
总是信守诺言。

22:30.172 --> 22:32.586
That carpet is clean.
那块地毯很干净。

22:32.655 --> 22:34.275
- And I helped.
- 我也帮忙了。

22:34.344 --> 22:35.827
- You sure did, buddy.
- 你确实做到了，伙计。

22:35.896 --> 22:37.827
Come on, pal,
let's go get us a snack.
来吧，朋友，
我们去买点零食吧。

22:37.896 --> 22:41.137
- Oh, I like that sound,
SpongeBob.
- 哦，我喜欢那个声音，
海绵宝宝。

22:41.206 --> 22:44.068
- [groaning]
- [呻吟]

22:44.137 --> 22:45.206
[hums]
[哼哼]

22:45.275 --> 22:46.310
[yelps]
[尖叫声]

22:46.379 --> 22:47.896
- [whistling]
- [吹口哨]

22:47.965 --> 22:49.793
Ah!
啊!

22:49.862 --> 22:51.862
- Ugh.
- I quit.
- 呃。
- 我不干了。

22:54.413 --> 22:57.344
[upbeat music]
[欢快的音乐]

22:57.413 --> 23:04.103
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

♪ ♪